> > > > > > > > > > > > > > authorities are
> > > > > > > > > > > > > > present they will 'compete' with one another, i.e.
> > > > > > > > > > > > > > they won't
> > > > > > > > > > > > > > be
> > > > > > > > > > > > > > independent, with a 'buffer' appearing between
> > > > > > > > > > > > > > authorities.
